    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11787" root="خوى" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَوَايَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَوَاةٌ</span>, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also The
<i>part that a horse closes with his tail, of the space
between his hind legs.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The <i>part</i> of a
spear-head <i>into which the shaft enters.</i> (K, * TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And The <i>wide part of the interior</i> of a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحْل</span>
[or camel's saddle]. (K, TA. [In the CK,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">من الرَّجُلِ</span> is erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">من الرَّحْلِ</span>.]) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَوَاةٌ</span>, second sentence.

